            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-4 pt-2 border-top border-secondary border-opacity-10">
              <span class="fs-7 text-muted"><i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1"></i> سال ۱۴۰۵</span>
              <a href="#" class="text-main fw-bold text-decoration-none fs-6">مشاهده جزییات <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i></a>
